  // ... existing exports ...
  clamp
};
```

This function uses `Math.min` and `Math.max` to ensure that the number is within the specified range. If the number is less than the minimum, it will be set to the minimum. If the number is greater than the maximum, it will be set to the maximum. Otherwise, it remains unchanged.

